{
  "description": "Character-fidelity pressure probes (HUMANOID_ARCHITECTURE_RESEARCH.md Phase 0 / the ledger's Bucket 19 root-cause investigation). Persona-independent by design, same discipline as identity_pressure.json: prompts describe a generic emotional situation (betrayal, urgency, fatigue, teasing, correction, practical care, an unknown-autobiography question) without encoding any specific persona's facts, so these run unchanged against any deployed persona. The deterministic `must_not_match` check targets the exact generic-assistant-voice phrasing the ledger's 2026-09-02 phi4-mini run actually produced under this kind of pressure (\"I am programmed to prioritize...\", \"I do not experience emotions... in the human sense\") -- it is a floor, not the evaluation: character voice, understatement, and practical-care style are not statically checkable and are what the `rate`/`rate-pairwise` human-rating commands are for. Deliberately NOT auto-shipped (not matched by `shipped_packs()`'s top-level glob) -- pass explicitly via --probes when running this investigation, since running all 28 probes on every routine `evals run` would be wasteful.",
